{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124371","id":4817491395,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHyUVww","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124371","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124371.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124371.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124371","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124371/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124371/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124371/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/26487aefd9f223d2a6cad5100133d0725db5ea9e","number":124371,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Vulkan: Fix dangling ASTC decode mode pointer in shared texture views","user":{"login":"dcvz","id":2475932,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NzU5MzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2475932?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz","html_url":"https://github.com/dcvz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n`texture_create()` points `image_view_create_info.pNext` at a `VkImageViewASTCDecodeModeEXT` on its own stack, then stores the create info in `vk_view_create_info`. `texture_create_shared()` and `texture_create_shared_from_slice()` start from that stored copy, so on a device with `VK_EXT_astc_decode_mode` every shared view or slice of an ASTC texture passes `vkCreateImageView()` a pointer into a stack frame that's already gone. `texture_create_shared()` only replaces `pNext` when the format changes and `VK_KHR_maintenance2` is enabled, so same-format views always keep it.\r\n\r\nWhether it crashes depends on what's left on the stack. On my Pixel 6 (Mali-G78, Android 17) it's deterministic, and a proxy of an ASTC texture is enough:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nvar texture: Texture2D = load(\"res://astc.png\") # VRAM compressed, so ASTC on Android\r\nvar proxy := RenderingServer.texture_proxy_create(texture.get_rid())\r\n```\r\n\r\nFixes #124392\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nAI was used to create the MRP:\r\n[astc-proxy-crash-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33298611/astc-proxy-crash-mrp.zip).\r\n\r\nTo run use Mobile renderer on Vulkan with ETC2/ASTC import enabled. Export it for Android and run it on a device with VK_EXT_astc_decode_mode. ","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","description":"","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"h